an>Libre sa Bayarin para sa mga First-Time Jobseekers (RA 11261)</span></div><div class="space-y-2"><h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">Serbisyo <span class="text-amber-400">PH</span></h1><p class="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-blue-100 tracking-normal">“Gabay sa Trabaho, Serbisyo ng Gobyerno &amp; Oportunidad”</p></div><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">Maligayang pagdating sa Serbisyo PH! Ang iyong libre, maaasahan, at madaling gamiting plataporma para sa paggawa ng modernong resume, pagkuha ng mga opisyal na ID at clearances, at paghahanap ng lehitimong trabaho sa Pilipinas.</p><div class="pt-2 max-w-xl mx-auto"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-2 shadow-2xl flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700 cursor-pointer hover:ring-4 hover:ring-blue-400/30 transition-all border border-slate-200"><div class="pl-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg></div><div class="flex-1 text-left text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 font-medium truncate py-2">Maghanap: "NBI clearance", "SSS registration", "Fresh grad resume"...</div><button type="button" class="px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-xl transition-colors shrink-0 shadow-xs cursor-pointer">Maghanap</button></div></div><div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate-300"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" ari